blic","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nExposes the GTFS Feed Version via the GTFS GraphQl API.\r\nThis can be used by clients to determine the Data Version used by a specific OTP instance.\r\nThis may be helpful to prevent unnecessary, expensive Data Updates (e.g. list of all routes), when no new feed Version was deployed, between attempted updates.\r\n\r\n### Unit tests\r\n\r\n- extended FeedInfoTestFactory to include feedversion\r\n- extended feedinfo.json and feedinfo.graphql used by GraphQLIntegrationTest to query for and expect feedversion\r\n- tested manually with local instance\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n- added short description for the new Field in GraphQl Schema\r\n","labels":[{"id":626499,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MjY0OTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opentripplanner/OpenTripPlanner/labels/!Improvement","name":"!Improvement","description":"A functional improvement or micro feature","color":"d7e102","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15197866,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAB-LNc4A5-aq","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opentripplanner/OpenTripPlanner/milestones/41","html_url":"https://github.com/opentripplanner/OpenTripPlanner/milestone/41","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opentripplanner/OpenTripPlanner/milestones/41/labels","number":41,"state":"closed","title":"2.10","description":"","creator":{"login":"t2gran","id":5525340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjUzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5525340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran","html_url":"https://github.com/t2gran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t2gran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"http